notes = "Actual spatial UUID/anchor/wall_assembly and absolute owner age drive the opt-in native source. Current optical occupants never assert contact. Only exact native contact ancestry supplies named pulses; visibility loss and real removal remain distinct. Native output and human visual acceptance require original-case evidence."
